There are two main techniques for identifying which gems are valuable
and which are glass.  One can be used anywhere, but only distinguishes
some of the valuable gems.  The second requires a chest or box, but
it distinguished all the valuable gems from glass.

Method 1:
#E)ngave with the gem.  Hard valuable gems will cut into the rock, while
soft valuable gems and glass will simply write in the dust.

Method 2:
Place gems in a chest or box (with #Loot) and kick it.  Make sure your
strength isn't above 18/**, or the chest or box might get kicked
across the room!  Any glass will shatter and disappear, while all
valuable gems will survive.  Not all glass will shatter with one kick--
my rule of thumb is to keep kicking until everything has shattered or
I manage to kick 10 times in a row with nothing shattering.
